msgid "Documentation for the latest version of Qiskit bosons"
msgstr "Dokumentasi untuk versi terbaru Qiskit bosons"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit Bosons"
msgstr "Qiskit Bosons"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit Bosons {#qiskit-bosons}"
msgstr "Qiskit Bosons {#qiskit-bosons}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "`qiskit-bosons` extends the Qiskit SDK with tools for working on bosonic systems. Within its scope it provides the following:\n"
msgstr "`qiskit-bosons` memperluas Qiskit SDK dengan alat untuk mengerjakan sistem bosonik. Dalam cakupannya, paket ini menyediakan hal-hal berikut:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "An efficient data structure for the representation and manipulation of bosonic operators\n"
msgstr "Struktur data yang efisien untuk merepresentasikan dan memanipulasi operator bosonik\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "A framework for implementing boson-to-qubit encodings, built around shared level encodings (unary with or without projectors, standard binary, Gray), and a library of common mappers\n"
msgstr "Framework untuk mengimplementasikan encoding boson-ke-qubit, dibangun di sekitar encoding level bersama (unary dengan atau tanpa proyektor, binary standar, Gray), plus library mapper yang umum dipakai\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "A framework and library of gates for expressing bosonic circuits\n"
msgstr "Framework dan library gate untuk mengekspresikan circuit bosonik\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '*   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "A transpilation pipeline integrated with the Qiskit transpiler process to synthesize bosonic circuits into qubit-based circuits\n"
msgstr "Pipeline transpilasi yang terintegrasi dengan proses Transpiler Qiskit untuk mensintesis circuit bosonik menjadi circuit berbasis qubit\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Get started {#get-started}"
msgstr "Mulai {#get-started}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This package covers the whole path from a bosonic operator to a qubit circuit. You can work in the bosonic regime with both, operator and circuit representation, before you choose a truncation and a boson-to-qubit encoding that plug into the multi-representation transpiler pipeline of Qiskit.\n"
msgstr "Paket ini mencakup seluruh alur dari operator bosonik sampai circuit qubit. Kamu bisa bekerja di rezim bosonik dengan representasi operator maupun circuit, sebelum memilih truncation dan encoding boson-ke-qubit yang masuk ke pipeline transpiler multi-representasi Qiskit.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "All of these features are explained in [several guides](/addons/qiskit-bosons/guides/overview) to help you get started. For an end-to-end overview, start with the [Bose-Hubbard guide](/addons/qiskit-bosons/guides/bose-hubbard).\n"
msgstr "Semua fitur ini dijelaskan di [beberapa panduan](/addons/qiskit-bosons/guides/overview) untuk membantumu memulai. Untuk gambaran menyeluruh dari ujung ke ujung, mulai dengan [panduan Bose-Hubbard](/addons/qiskit-bosons/guides/bose-hubbard).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Technical discussion {#technical-discussion}"
msgstr "Pembahasan teknis {#technical-discussion}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Design intentions {#design-intentions}"
msgstr "Maksud desain {#design-intentions}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This package is deliberately designed to align with Qiskit: it builds on a core implemented in Rust and provides first-party language bindings to Python. Its API intends to draw parallels to Qiskit in order to seamlessly integrate into the workflows of users with experience in programming Qiskit. While there exists no C API right now, the architecture is set up to support one if the need for one ever arises in the future. The architecture of this package is also deliberately analogous to that of [qiskit-fermions](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-fermions).\n"
msgstr "Paket ini sengaja dirancang agar selaras dengan Qiskit: dibangun di atas inti yang diimplementasikan dalam Rust dan menyediakan language binding first-party ke Python. API-nya berusaha menyerupai Qiskit agar terintegrasi mulus ke alur kerja pengguna yang berpengalaman memprogram Qiskit. Meski saat ini belum ada C API, arsitekturnya disiapkan untuk mendukungnya jika suatu saat dibutuhkan. Arsitektur paket ini juga sengaja dibuat analog dengan [qiskit-fermions](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit-fermions).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "A core principle to the design of `qiskit-bosons` was the decoupling of its bosonic circuit representation from its qubitized form. To be more precise: the bosonic circuits are meaningful by themselves and do not require a mapping to qubit space to be interpretable. Furthermore, the bosonic circuit representation cannot make any assumptions about the truncation and boson-to-qubit encoding applied later on. Both enter only at transpile time.\n"
msgstr "Prinsip inti dalam desain `qiskit-bosons` adalah memisahkan representasi circuit bosonik dari bentuk qubitisasinya. Lebih tepatnya: circuit bosonik bermakna dengan sendirinya dan tidak membutuhkan pemetaan ke ruang qubit agar bisa ditafsirkan. Selain itu, representasi circuit bosonik tidak boleh membuat asumsi apa pun tentang truncation dan encoding boson-ke-qubit yang diterapkan kemudian. Keduanya baru masuk saat waktu transpile.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Deprecation policy {#deprecation-policy}"
msgstr "Kebijakan deprecation {#deprecation-policy}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "We follow [semantic versioning](https://semver.org/) and are guided by the principles in [Qiskit’s deprecation policy](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit/blob/main/DEPRECATION.md). We may occasionally make breaking changes in order to improve the user experience. When possible, we will keep old interfaces and mark them as deprecated, as long as they can co-exist with the new ones. Each substantial improvement, breaking change, or deprecation will be documented in the [release notes](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/release-notes).\n"
msgstr "Kami mengikuti [semantic versioning](https://semver.org/) dan berpedoman pada prinsip dalam [kebijakan deprecation Qiskit](https://github.com/Qiskit/qiskit/blob/main/DEPRECATION.md). Sesekali kami mungkin membuat perubahan yang merusak (breaking change) demi memperbaiki pengalaman pengguna. Jika memungkinkan, kami akan mempertahankan antarmuka lama dan menandainya sebagai deprecated, selama masih bisa berdampingan dengan yang baru. Setiap peningkatan besar, breaking change, atau deprecation akan didokumentasikan di [catatan rilis](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-bosons/release-notes).\n"

